1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,779
Welcome to Module 7, all about Sites.

2
00:00:02,779 --> 00:00:07,892
Before we build anything, let's answer the
most common question: should you build a

3
00:00:07,892 --> 00:00:09,186
funnel, or a website?

4
00:00:09,186 --> 00:00:13,129
By the end of this lesson, you'll
know exactly when to use each.

5
00:00:13,982 --> 00:00:17,674
Everything people see on the
web lives here, under Sites.

6
00:00:17,674 --> 00:00:22,920
Funnels, websites, forms, surveys, your
chat widget, QR codes, blogs and domains.

7
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:28,295
They all share the same page builder, so
once you learn it, you can build anything.

8
00:00:29,148 --> 00:00:30,776
Let's start with funnels.

9
00:00:30,776 --> 00:00:36,115
A funnel is a short series of pages that
guides someone towards one single action,

10
00:00:36,115 --> 00:00:38,264
like booking a free consultation.

11
00:00:38,264 --> 00:00:41,194
There's no menu and
nothing to wander off to.

12
00:00:41,194 --> 00:00:45,687
Every page has one job, and the
visitor always knows what to do next.

13
00:00:46,538 --> 00:00:49,152
Each page in a funnel is called a step.

14
00:00:49,152 --> 00:00:51,566
Bloom's Invisalign funnel has three.

15
00:00:51,566 --> 00:00:55,454
First, an opt-in page that
collects the visitor's details.

16
00:00:55,454 --> 00:00:57,867
Then a booking page with a calendar.

17
00:00:57,867 --> 00:00:59,878
And finally, a thank-you page.

18
00:01:00,728 --> 00:01:04,106
Because a funnel is a fixed
path, it's easy to measure.

19
00:01:04,106 --> 00:01:09,144
You can see how many people reached each
step, and exactly where they dropped off.

20
00:01:09,144 --> 00:01:13,198
That makes funnels perfect for
ads, special offers and promotions.

21
00:01:14,046 --> 00:01:14,957
Now, websites.

22
00:01:14,957 --> 00:01:18,602
A website is a set of pages
joined by a navigation menu,

23
00:01:18,602 --> 00:01:21,336
so visitors can explore at their own pace.

24
00:01:21,336 --> 00:01:23,679
Home, treatments, about us, contact.

25
00:01:23,679 --> 00:01:29,081
It's your online shop window, and the place
people check before they trust you with

26
00:01:29,081 --> 00:01:29,862
their teeth.

27
00:01:30,712 --> 00:01:33,323
Notice the menu across
the top of the page.

28
00:01:33,323 --> 00:01:36,237
People who are still
researching like to browse,

29
00:01:36,237 --> 00:01:38,605
compare treatments and get to know you.

30
00:01:38,605 --> 00:01:43,584
A website is also what Google shows when
someone searches for a dentist near them.

31
00:01:44,434 --> 00:01:46,133
So here's the rule of thumb.

32
00:01:46,133 --> 00:01:50,139
If you're promoting one offer and
want one action, build a funnel.

33
00:01:50,139 --> 00:01:55,054
If you want to show your whole business
and help people explore, build a website.

34
00:01:55,054 --> 00:01:56,571
Most businesses use both.

35
00:01:57,422 --> 00:01:59,632
And they work beautifully together.

36
00:01:59,632 --> 00:02:03,737
Your website's Invisalign page
can link to your free scan funnel.

37
00:02:03,737 --> 00:02:06,389
Your ads can point straight at the funnel.

38
00:02:06,389 --> 00:02:09,736
And every lead from either
one lands in the same CRM,

39
00:02:09,736 --> 00:02:13,777
triggers the same automations,
and shows up in the same reports.

40
00:02:14,628 --> 00:02:18,518
Best of all, you build both with
the same drag and drop editor.

41
00:02:18,518 --> 00:02:22,160
The same sections, the same
elements, the same mobile view.

42
00:02:22,160 --> 00:02:25,865
Learn it once, and you can build
funnels, websites and more.

43
00:02:26,714 --> 00:02:27,781
Here's a pro tip.

44
00:02:27,781 --> 00:02:30,165
Don't try to build everything at once.

45
00:02:30,165 --> 00:02:34,745
Start with one funnel for your most
profitable offer, send traffic to it,

46
00:02:34,745 --> 00:02:36,878
and improve it using real numbers.

47
00:02:36,878 --> 00:02:38,698
Your full website can follow.

48
00:02:39,549 --> 00:02:41,477
Now you know when to use each one.

49
00:02:41,477 --> 00:02:45,843
In the next lesson, we'll build a complete
funnel from a ready-made template,

50
00:02:45,843 --> 00:02:46,694
and publish it.

51
00:02:46,694 --> 00:02:47,488
See you there.
